[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Anti-gravity A1 features invisible sensing'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'capabilities. We recommend enabling obstacle avoidance when flying. The drone\'s obstacle avoidance system is'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'enabled by default, [music] seen in the lower right corner. It has three states: enabled, manually disabled, or disabled. Try to keep an eye on it as you fly. If you need to'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'disable it for specific scenarios, use the controller to open the menu. Go to safety settings at the bottom of the menu bar. [music] Then set obstacle avoidance behavior to off.'

[00:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'The default obstacle avoidance mode is brake stop.'

[01:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'When the drone detects an obstacle in its flight path, [music] it will stop and display a red frame on the vision goggles along with a warning prompt. [music] If you attempt to continue flying'

[01:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'forward, the drone will remain stationary. The drone\'s obstacle avoidance system provides safety assistance only under limited conditions and cannot replace human judgment or manual control. It may'

[01:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'not accurately detect narrow or thin objects such as cranes, power towers, wires, or tree branches. Performance may also be affected by'

[01:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'reflective [music] or transparent surfaces such as mirrors, glass, ice, or water, low light environments, solid colored surfaces, or moving objects. [music] When flying in these conditions, avoid'

[01:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'high speeds, stay aware of your surroundings, closely monitor any warnings shown in the vision goggles, and [music] maintain full control of the drone at all times. The navigation assist window displays'

[02:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the drone\'s flight direction and supports obstacle detection. [music] In free motion mode, when the vision goggles view is not aligned with the drone\'s flight direction, the navigation assist appears at the top of'

[02:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the display. [music] It automatically disappears once the goggles are aligned with the drone\'s flight direction. [music] When using the slider to ascend or descend, the navigation assist will'

[02:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'indicate the corresponding movement up or down, even if the waypoint is not visible in the [music] frame. While obstacle avoidance is designed to [music] help make flying easy and'

[02:49] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'approachable, it\'s not perfect. When flying, we still recommend keeping a safe [music] distance from crowds in public areas to avoid accidents that could cause injury. Thank you for watching.'
